content:
The `spectrum.js` initialization I added isn't working — likely because the colourpicker package's JS dependency isn't being loaded on the page (it's only included when a `colourInput` is rendered directly, not when it's hidden inside a `<template>`). The `<template>` content is inert DOM, so the browser never parses or loads its dependencies.

The fix: add colourpicker's HTML dependency explicitly to the `multiDynamicInput` widget so spectrum.js is guaranteed to be on the page. Then the `initSpecialInputs` code will have `$.fn.spectrum` available. 

